      "content": "wow that's a pretty strong take. you're saying staying neutral is basically complicit? i'm just worried about the bottom line though. if we alienate a huge chunk of our user base who thinks this tax is just more government overreach or bad for the economy, we could lose a lot of revenue. aren't there valid business reasons to just keep our mouths shut and focus on the products?",
